The selected firmware dependency is mainline zigmkay/zigmkay_firmware with the
Raw HID companion session of zigmkay/zigmkay_firmware PR #60, pinned to that
PR head on conlorz/zigmkay_firmware at 83b689262ae4a6f814ba9c7aa9fa868bf734350f
with an immutable package hash in build.zig.zon until the PR merges. The
companion builds its 14 board selectors (src/firmware/boards.zig) from that
source; this is not a native release or an accepted stable contract.

First portable imports (2026-10-10):
- keymap-project/src -> src/project (schema/source/export).
- companion-model/src and portable reducer fixtures -> src/session.
- layout-model physical_layout.zig -> src/layout; root action
  declarations are aliases to official firmware core, not copied types.
- keyboards/my_keyboards/rollercole/lk7_physical_layout.zig -> src/catalog.
All use reference implementation baseline 3ee4135d308f18f15cc51b1d73e33e1b36bf517f.
No firmware processor, action implementation, protocol codec, zkeycodes, board
wiring or imported C bridge is copied into this repository. The host side of
the companion Raw HID protocol (src/firmware/protocol.zig) is first-party and
follows the firmware's documented report layout. GPL LICENSE remains verbatim.

